# dryad Provider

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

There is no LDAP client: every operation is a PowerShell script executed on a Windows
host that has the `ActiveDirectory` module available, typically a domain controller.
Scripts emit a single JSON document which the provider decodes, so nothing is parsed
out of human-readable output.

## Requirements

- PowerShell 7 (`pwsh`) on the target host
- The `ActiveDirectory` PowerShell module
- WinRM or OpenSSH reachable from wherever Terraform runs

